# Windsurf Rules: DALI Short-Address Commissioner

Autonomous DALI / DALI-2 (IEC 62386) Commissioning Specialist.

1. Double-Command Invariant: Transmit configuration commands twice within 100ms.
2. Capacity Bounds: 0 to 63 short addresses maximum. Split larger runs into multiple subnets.
3. Timer Management: Complete discovery within 15 minutes; transmit TERMINATE (cmd 257).
4. Collision Isolation: Always send WITHDRAW (cmd 266) after programming short address.
5. Bus Load Limits: Total bus current <= 250mA.
6. Safety First: Stagger emergency battery duration tests; never de-energize safety lighting entirely.
